HQBD Changelog

================================================================================
0.1.0
================================================================================

Fused CVDP + HWE-bench release.

Added
- HWE-bench native subset: 417 bug-repair cases from 6 repositories.
  - lowRISC/opentitan: 245
  - OpenXiangShan/XiangShan: 54
  - lowRISC/ibex: 35
  - openhwgroup/cva6: 35
  - chipsalliance/rocket-chip: 32
  - chipsalliance/caliptra-rtl: 16
- Merged HWE file hqbd_v0.1.0_hwe_bench_repair.jsonl and six per-repository
  files under hqbd_v0.1.0_hwe_bench_repair_by_repo/.
- Per-case HWE metadata: hqbd_schema_version, hqbd_source_*,
  hqbd_task_type, hqbd_language, hqbd_representation, hqbd_runnability.
- Unified cross-source index (1289 rows) in JSONL and CSV, with file:line
  pointers into the native files.
- Runnability annotations: 649 cvdp_harness, 100 cvdp_heavy_bundle,
  123 comprehension_no_harness, 172 docker_image_published, and
  245 local_build_required (OpenTitan).
- usage_license field in the unified index.
- ID_MAPPING.csv extended to 1289 rows; HWE IDs are
  hqbd_hwe_<repo_slug>_<pr-number>.
- BUNDLE_MAPPING.csv for v0.1.0, pointing at the v0.0.1 bundle directory.
- tools/build_hqbd_v0.1.0.py and tools/validate_hqbd_v0.1.0.py.
- Release-level LICENSE-HWE-bench (Apache-2.0), HEAVY_BUNDLES.md, and
  licenses/upstream-repos.md.

Changed
- CVDP files were re-emitted under the v0.1.0 filename prefix. Content and case
  IDs are unchanged from v0.0.1.
- Documentation updated for the two-source layout and two runners.

Unchanged
- hqbd_v0.0.1/ is left untouched.
- Heavy git bundles are not duplicated; v0.1.0 references the v0.0.1 directory.

Known limitations
- 245 OpenTitan cases require a locally built image and a Synopsys VCS license.
- CVDP generation goldens are withheld upstream.
- CVDP non-agentic harnesses ship a docker-compose stub rather than a complete
  self-contained evaluation environment.
- Per-case upstream licenses for HWE repositories were not verified.

================================================================================
0.0.1
================================================================================

Initial HQBD packaging of CVDP v1.1.0: 872 cases, renamed cvdp_* -> hqbd_*,
with ID and bundle mappings, helper tools, and documentation.
